# does not settle: S-85 -- the seed runs zone 1 backwards (a plain split hands every branch the whole flow).
# Layout ladder, step 12 (29, C-126): three heating zones on one pump, each a plain branch -- a valve and a load --
# hung between the supply and the return header.

fluidscript 1
circuit zones
fluid water

PU1 pump
HE1 heat_exchanger power=60 in.t=40 out.t=70
CV1 valve kv=4
CV2 valve kv=4
CV3 valve kv=4
LD1 heat_exchanger power=-20
LD2 heat_exchanger power=-20
LD3 heat_exchanger power=-20

connections
PU1 - HE1
HE1 - NS
NS - NA1
NA1 - CV1 - LD1 - NR1 - NB1
NA1 - NA2
NA2 - CV2 - LD2 - NR2 - NB2
NA2 - CV3 - LD3 - NR3 - NB2
NB2 - NB1
NB1 - NP
NP - PU1

